\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces Model selection on the tune part. Because the manual segment is near-balanced (31.94\% churn on tune), the F1-optimal threshold for all three models is close to 0.5. M3 wins by tune log-loss.}}{16}{}\protected@file@percent }
